    "join_key_reasoning": "The candidate join keys are store_id (stores \u2194 sales_data) and product_id (sales_data \u2194 products). store_id appears in both tables and is the natural foreign key linking each transaction to its store; however, the 2.69% nulls in sales_data.store_id must be resolved before the join. product_id is present in sales_data and products with no nulls, making it a reliable key to bring product attributes (category, standard_price) into the sales fact table. These keys enable a star\u2011schema style join for analytics while preserving referential integrity."
